<section class="founder-confession">
    <div class="container overflow-visible">
        <div class="glass-container">
            <div class="content">
                <h2 class="title">"I built this to solve my own headache."</h2>
                <div class="body">
                    <p>
                        I didn't start NotionGlaze as a project to sell. I
                        started it because I was tired of second-guessing my own
                        blog.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        I love Notion. But the technical friction was killing my
                        momentum. I spent more time checking if my images were
                        still alive than actually writing. I wanted a way to
                        publish my thoughts that felt as seamless as the writing
                        experience itself.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        I built the engine I needed. One that prioritizes pure
                        speed, rock-solid reliability, and a clean,
                        distraction-free aesthetic.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="footer">
                    <div class="founder-info">
                        <strong>— HUMANERD</strong>
                        <span>Creator of NotionGlaze</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="visual">
                <div class="avatar-wrapper">
                    <div class="frustrated-emoji">😤</div>
                    <!-- Future: Add an actual photo or generated character here -->
                    <div class="avatar-placeholder">HN</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .founder-confession {
        padding: 6rem 0;
        background: hsl(var(--background));
        position: relative;
    }

    .glass-container {
        background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.03);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border: 1px solid hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);
        border-radius: 40px;
        padding: 5rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
        gap: 4rem;
        align-items: center;
        box-shadow: 0 40px 100px -20px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.1);
    }

    .title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-style: italic;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        font-family: serif;
    }

    .body p {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: hsl(var(--foreground));
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .footer {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .founder-info strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .founder-info span {
        color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
        font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    .visual {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .avatar-wrapper {
        width: 180px;
        height: 180px;
        background: hsl(var(--primary));
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px hsl(var(--primary) / 0.5);
    }

    .avatar-placeholder {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: white;
    }

    .frustrated-emoji {
        position: absolute;
        top: -10px;
        right: -10px;
        font-size: 3rem;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 50%;
        width: 60px;
        height: 60px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.1);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .glass-container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .visual {
            order: -1;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .glass-container {
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
        }
        .avatar-wrapper {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
        }
        .avatar-placeholder {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
        .frustrated-emoji {
            font-size: 2rem;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
        }
    }
</style>
